abstract: >-
  A library of 25 ATT&CK v19.2-aligned threat-hunting playbooks with Microsoft KQL hunts and portable
  Sigma detection and correlation rules. Every Sigma rule ships with synthetic true-positive and
  false-positive unit tests executed by an included Sigma evaluation engine; ATT&CK
  technique, detection-strategy and Atomic Red Team references are validated against pinned snapshots
  of the upstream sources.
